 3 Streams       │ › 1. Sign in
 4 History       │      Sign in to your AudD account (or paste an API token) so
 5 Account       │      audd can recognize music and show your account.
 6 Settings      │      $ audd login
*7 Help          │ 
                 │   2. Recognize a file
                 │      Pick a file, URL, or folder and recognize it. This fills
                 │      in AudD's example song.
                 │      $ audd recognize https://audd.tech/example.mp3
                 │ 
                 │   3. Use the microphone
                 │      In Recognize, set Source to Microphone to record a few
                 │      seconds and identify the song.
                 │      $ audd listen
                 │ 
                 │   4. Add a stream
 ctrl+k commands │      Have AudD monitor a radio or other live stream, then
 ? keys  q quit  │      watch it in Now playing.
